Title:  The wonder remains

Seq:    12.6.176.1.1

Level:  6 - Subdetail

Class:  quote

Timestamp: 20251218192020

Date Added: 2025-12-18 12:20:20 -0700

Date Modified: 2026-10-15 12:27:06 -0600

Referenced In: First and last, there is wonder

Body:

Philosophy begins in wonder. And, at the end, when philosophic thought has done its best, the wonder remains.

